rnal wallet before \u003c0\u003e{restrictTime}\u003c/0\u003e .Unsupported tokens will remain in your account in Withdrawal-Only Mode after that date.","kyc.ae.steps.complete":"Please make sure to complete the above steps to ensure your assets and positions are fully migrated without any issues.","kyc.ae.details.more":"For more details on the migration process, you can view the full announcement \u003c0\u003e[here]\u003c/0\u003e or visit our \u003c1\u003e[FAQ page]\u003c/1\u003e.","kyc.ae.verify.next":"Please proceed to the next step to initiate your verification.","news.room.january":"January","news.room.february":"February","news.room.march":"March","news.room.april":"April","news.room.may":"May","news.room.june":"June","news.room.july":"July","news.room.august":"August","news.room.september":"September","news.room.october":"October","news.room.november":"November","news.room.december":"December","my.kyb.prompt":"Prompt","kyc.us.no.slots":"Not enough available slots. Only {available} slot(s) available.","kychome.almost.there":"Almost There!","kychome.complete.now":"Complete Now","kychome.pending":"Pending","kychome.verify.complete":"Your identity has been successfully verified. Complete the remaining information to unlock full account privileges.","kyc.proof.docs":"Please provide proof of address documents such as:","kyc.utility.bill":"Utility bill (electricity, phone, etc)","kyc.bank.statement":"Bank statement","kyc.rental.agree":"Rental agreement","kyc.title.deed":"Title deed","kyc.doc.note":"Note: The document must contain your legal name, issue date, and full address, and must be issued within the last 3 months.","kyc.limit.monthly":"You have reached your monthly {type} limit.","kyc.limit.upgrade":"To increase your monthly limits, please contact our Support Team at \u003c0\u003e{email}\u003c/0\u003e or check your eligibility to upgrade to a Qualified Investor account.","kyc.btn.not.now":"Not Now","kyc.btn.qualified":"Become a Qualified Investor","kyc.upgrade.req":"To upgrade your account from Retail Investor to Qualified Investor, you must meet the following requirements and submit the necessary supporting documents.","kyc.req.knowledge":"1. You must have relevant knowledge of Virtual Assets or complex structured products.","kyc.req.also":"2. Also you must:","kyc.assets.maintain":"a. maintain net assets (comprising fiat currency, financial instruments, Virtual Assets, and/or equity in tangible real estate assets, or any combination thereof) of at least AED 3,500,000 in equivalent value, supported by documentary proof of funds demonstrating that the relevant assets have remained, and will remain, liquid for at least 3 months. Please note that this may be verified periodically by Gate.","kyc.assets.exclude":"i. The following assets shall be excluded from the calculation of an individual's net assets:","kyc.primary.res":"1. the value of any property constituting the individual's primary residence, including any equity held by the individual net of any obligations secured against that residence;","kyc.insurance.rts":"2. any rights of the individual under a qualifying contract of insurance; and","kyc.pension.ben":"3. any benefits (in the form of pensions or otherwise), which are payable on the termination of the individual's service, or on death or retirement, and to which the individual or the individual's dependents are, or may be, entitled; and","kyc.va.market.val":"ii. Please note that only 50% of the market value of your Virtual Assets shall be included;","kyc.income.req":"b. OR you must have an annual income of AED 700,000 or more.","kyc.apply.upgrade":"If you meet the above criteria, you are eligible to apply to upgrade your account to Qualified Investor status. To proceed, you must submit the following documents.","kyc.qualified.def":"Qualified Investor is an investor who possesses the experience, knowledge, and expertise to make informed investment decisions and properly assess the risks associated with all investment services, activities, and financial instruments.","kyc.btn.continue":"Continue to Upgrade","kyc.asset.decl.form":"Net Asset Declaration Form (Individual)","kyc.form.instruct":"Instruction: Please download, complete and sign the declaration regarding your financial standing.","kyc.file.format":"JPG, PNG, or PDF—max 10 MB per file, up to 20 files total.","kyc.prof.exp.know":"Professional Experience \u0026 Knowledge","kyc.upload.instruct":"Instruction: Please upload one of the following documents to demonstrate your expertise.","kyc.prof.cert":"Professional Certifications","kyc.cert.examples":"CFA, FRM, CAIA, blockchain- or crypto-specific certifications (e.g., CBP, CDAA), or any training certificates issued by exchanges, academies, or crypto education platforms.","kyc.employ.exp":"Employment or Professional Experience Evidence","kyc.employ.evidence":"Employment evidence from a crypto exchange, investment bank, trading firm, or asset management firm.","kyc.invest.exp":"Investment Experience Evidence","kyc.invest.evidence":"Evidence of investment experience in crypto assets (spot/futures/perpetuals) or structured products (ETNs, notes, derivatives), in the form of account statement(s) showing activity in any of the listed products.","kyc.fin.req":"Financial Requirements","kyc.option.select":"Please select either Option A or Option B based on your financial standing.","kyc.net.assets":"Net Assets (Min. AED 3,500,000)","kyc.asset.proof":"Bank statement or investment account statement (issued within the last 3 months, covering at least 6 months of historical activity); Virtual Asset proof (50% of market value is applicable); Real Estate ownership evidence (excluding the individual's primary residence).","kyc.annual.inc":"Annual Income (Min. AED 700,000)","kyc.income.proof":"Salary certificate or a 6-month bank/account statement reflecting regular income of at least AED 700,000 per annum.","kyc.monthly.limit":"Monthly Limit Reached","kyc.asset.decl":"Net Asset Declaration Form","kyc.decl.instruct":"Instruction: Please download, complete and sign the declaration regarding your financial standing. This form must be signed by the designated Authorized Person only.","kyc.upload.docs":"Please upload at least one (1) of the following documents pertaining to a Director, UBO, or the Authorized Person (Trader).","kyc.cred.note":"Note: Credentials can belong to a Director, UBO, or the designated Authorized Person (Trader). However, if the account manager (Trader) is not a Director, the submitted credentials must belong to that Trader.","kyc.prof.certs":"Professional Certifications","kyc.cert.examples2":"Examples: CFA, FRM, CAIA, blockchain- or crypto-specific certifications (e.g., CBP, CDAA), or any training certificates issued by exchanges, academies, or crypto education platforms.","kyc.prof.exp":"Professional Experience","kyc.exp.examples":"Examples: Employment or professional experience evidence from a crypto exchange, trading firm, investment bank, or asset management firm.","kyc.invest.exp2":"Investment Experience","kyc.exp.examples2":"Examples: Evidence of investment experience evidencing investment activity in crypto assets (spot/futures/perpetuals) or structured products (ETNs, notes, derivatives).","kyc.fin.reqs":"Financial Requirements","kyc.entity.instruct":"Instruction: The entity must demonstrate net assets of at least AED 3,500,000.","kyc.fin.examples":"Examples: Bank statement or investment account statement (issued within the last 3 months, covering at least 6 months of historical activity); Virtual Asset proof (50% of market value is applicable); Real Estate ownership evidence.","chatroom_day":"day","chatroom_month":"month","chatroom_year":"year","kyc.app.review":"Application Under Review","kyc.docs.submitted":"Your documents have been submitted successfully. We appreciate your patience while we carefully review your information.","kyc.eligibility.req":"Eligibility Requirements","kyc.knowledge.req":"You must have relevant knowledge of virtual assets or complex structured products.","kyc.also.must":"Also you must:","kyc.assets.verify":"maintain net assets (comprising fiat currency, financial instruments, virtual assets, and/or equity in tangible real estate assets, or any combination thereof) of at least AED 3,500,000 in equivalent value, supported by documentary proof of funds demonstrating that the relevant assets have remained, and will remain, liquid for at least 3 months. Please note that this may be verified periodically by Gate.","kyc.assets.exclude2":"The following assets shall be excluded from the calculation of an individual's net assets:","kyc.residence.value":"the value of any property constituting the individual's primary residence, including any equity held by the individual net of any obligations secured against that residence;","kyc.insurance.rights":"any rights of the individual under a qualifying contract of insurance; and","kyc.virtual.50pct":"please note that only 50% of the market value of your virtual assets shall be included;","kyc.income.min":"Or you must have an annual income of AED 700,000 or more.","kyc.limit.upload":"You have reached your monthly {type} limit. Please upload Proof of Funds/Assets for a one-time approval of this specific transaction, or contact our Support Team at \u003c0\u003e{email}\u003c/0\u003e.","kycus.title.address":"Confirm Address","kycus.label.id_number":"ID Number","kycus.result.high_demand":"(It may take longer during periods of high demand)","kycus.personalinfo.desc":"Please review your personal information, modify if needed, then tap \"Next\" to continue.","kycus.addressinfo.desc":"Please review your address, modify if needed, then tap \"Next\" to continue.","kycus.result.time":"{minutes} Minutes","kycus.default.country":"United States of America","kycus.upload.file_size_tip.new":"The file supports JPG, JPEG, PNG, or PDF and should not exceed {size} MB","kyc.risk.warning":"Risk Warning","kyc.cfd.loss.risk":"CFD trading involves a hi