onses, you are not approved for CFD trading. You may retake the assessment.","kyc.risk.ack":"Risk Acknowledgement Required","kyc.cfd.unsuitable":"Based on your questionnaire responses, CFD trading may not be suitable for you.\nPlease click Continue to review the Risk Disclosure Notice.","kyc.cfd.review":"Your CFD account is currently under review.","kyc.try.again":"Try Again","kyc.start.assessment":"Start Assessment","kycae.employer.business.name":"Employer or Business Name","kycae.employer.business.name.placeholder":"Enter the company or business you work for","kyc.mt.poaguidetitle":"Verify Proof of Address","kyc.mt.poaguidedesc":"Bank statements, utility or internet bills, or a lease with your full address, issued within 6 months.","kyc.mt.poaover6months":"Older than 6 months","kyc.mt.poascreenshots":"Screenshots","kyc.mt.poamobilebills":"Mobile phone bills","kyc.verify.on.mobile":"Verify Identity on Mobile","kyc.scan.to.continue.identity.verification":"Scan the QR code with your phone camera or the Gate App to continue your identity verification.","kyc.ae.poaguidedesc":"Bank statement, utility bill, Ejari/rental agreement, or title deed issued within the last 3 months.","kyc.ae.poaidphotos":"ID card, passport, selfie, or personal photos","kyc.ae.poascreenedited":"Digital screen, edited documents, or cropped documents","kyc.ae.poaover3months":"Missing detailed address / Issued more than 3 months ago","kyc.respermit":"Residence Permit","kyc.verifyrp":"Verify Residence Permit","kyc.update.en.name":"Update English Name","kyc.select.doc.type":"Select Document Type","kyc.choose.doc.verify":"Select the document you'll use to verify your English name.","kyc.verify.en.name":"Verify English Name","kyc.upload.doc.inst":"Upload a valid document that includes your English name. This document will only be used to verify your English name.","kyc.en.name":"English Name","kyc.enter.name.match":"Enter your name exactly as shown in English on the document you uploaded.","kyc.allowe